{"task_id": "HumanEval/13", "solution": "def greatest_common_divisor(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\" Return a greatest common divisor of two integers a and b using the Euclidean algorithm.\n    Handles negative numbers and the special case gcd(0, 0) == 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    a, b = abs(a), abs(b)\n\n    if a == 0 and b == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    while b:\n        a, b = b, a % b\n    return a"}
