{"task_id": "HumanEval/79", "solution": "def decimal_to_binary(decimal):\n    \"\"\"Converts a decimal number to its binary string representation,\n    wrapped with 'db' prefix and suffix.\n    \"\"\"\n    if decimal == 0:\n        return \"db0db\"\n\n    # Convert decimal to binary bits string using bitwise operations\n    bits = []\n    n = decimal\n    while n > 0:\n        bits.append(\"1\" if (n & 1) else \"0\")\n        n >>= 1\n    bits.reverse()\n    binary_string = \"\".join(bits)\n\n    # Wrap the binary string with 'db' prefix and suffix\n    return f\"db{binary_string}db\""}
